//? Title: Exact decimal convolution: actual fixed-prime NTT stages and carries
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Multiply nonnegative decimal integers by exact finite-field convolution followed
by decimal carry propagation. The historical report filename is retained, while
the implemented bounded fixed-prime NTT method is distinguished from the
arbitrary-length Schönhage–Strassen ring algorithm.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

Write decimal inputs as little-endian digit polynomials. Transform both under
prime p=998244353 and primitive root 3, multiply corresponding residues, inverse
transform and carry in base ten. Pad N to a power of two at least the sum of the
normalized digit counts. Every ordinary coefficient is at most
81*min(a_digits,b_digits); checking that it is below p makes the recovered
residue equal to the integer coefficient. The hard root limit is N<=2^23. Three
radix-two transforms execute
$$ B=3N\log_2(N)/2 $$
\alttext(Three radix-two transforms execute three times N times log base two of N divided by two butterflies.)
butterflies. The report measures actual native butterflies and modular products;
it does not use an n log n curve as a substitute for measured work or claim a
wall-clock speedup.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/schonhage_strassen_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <bit>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/ntt_multiplication.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto r = a::ntt_multiply_trace("12", "34");
    std::print("Actual coefficient vector `{}`; product {}.\n\n| coefficient index | actual coefficient | " "incoming carry | digit | outgoing carry |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n",
               r.coefficients, r.product);
    for (const auto &s : r.carries)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", s.index, s.coefficient,
                   s.before, s.digit, s.after);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Digits [2,1] times [4,3]");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("Actual coefficients {}", r.coefficients));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Actual decimal product {}", r.product));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/schonhage_strassen_tiny.svg");
}
```
