| left | right | actual product | actual butterflies |
| --- | --- | --- | ---: |
| 0 | 999 | 0 | 0 |
| 00012 | 0034 | 408 | 12 |
| 9 | 9 | 81 | 3 |
| 9999 | 9999 | 99980001 | 36 |
Invalid second operand checked before zero shortcut true; transform policy rejection true.
\image(figures/schonhage_strassen_controls.svg)
